  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_002 (multimodal, singleprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, no aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves 0.537 validation accuracy. This experiment tests changing the image encoder from imagenet_vit_l to resnet50 while keeping other parameters identical, isolating the effect of the image encoder choice. This clarifies whether the image encoder significantly impacts performance, a critical design decision. It balances exploration (testing a different encoder) with exploitation (building on the existing multimodal setup)."
